msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"And I'll order champagne for Mitsuru-kun at Adam tomorrow, too. I love him "
"so much! ⑮"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Huh? You want to know where Adam is? Go up this hill and make a turn at the "
"end of the street. There, you'll find my wonderful, dreamy Mitsuru-kun... "
"I'll be there soon, my love!"
msgstr ""

